"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4306070-1845383656383268","game_id":"steam-4306070","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Live!","summary":"Hey everyone! After a long journey, the Catch Meow If You Can Demo is finally LIVE! 🎉🐱Since our playtest, we’ve been going through your feedback, fixing bugs, improving the gameplay, and polishing the experience as much as we can. A lot of the changes we made came directly from what you told us, so thank you again to everyone who took part and helped us along the way.And this is only the beginning. Catch Meow If You Can launches in full on October 29th!Until then, we hope you have fun with the d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T17:39:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4306070-1845383656377050","game_id":"steam-4306070","kind":"announcement","title":"We Just Reached 20,000 Wishlists!","summary":"Wow… 20,000 wishlists. When we first started working on Catch Meow If You Can, even imagining a number like this was exciting for us. It felt like one of those milestones every indie developer dreams about. What made this journey even more special was seeing how much the community cared about the game itself. Your feedback, comments about the gameplay, suggestions, and even the small details you pointed out helped us a lot throughout development. Knowing that people weren’t just following the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T10:21:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377050","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4306070-1843481262697432","game_id":"steam-4306070","kind":"announcement","title":"PUBLIC DEMO RELEASING OCT. 1st","summary":"Hey everyone! Our playtest is officially over! First of all, a huge thank you to everyone who jumped in, played with friends, sent us feedback on Discord or DMs, reported bugs, asked questions, or simply followed the game. We got a ton of useful feedback, and at this point we have what we need to get back to work. So we’ve closed the playtest and we’ll spend the next couple of weeks fixing bugs, polishing the rough edges, and getting everything ready. And now for the good part... Catch Meow If Y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T12:55:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697432","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4306070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4306070":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4306070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4613270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4306070","app_id":4306070,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8133b1675410315e60ed7ca0ec7f66d0fe5b392cfb3f1d17bb61e1524dfe2136","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"최대 4명이 함께 플레이할 수 있는 온라인 협동 생존 게임입니다. 유명한 대회 수상 고양이가 되어 플레이하세요. 주인이 집을 비운 사이, 다양한 유형의 도둑들이 저택에 침입합니다. 어두운 방을 탐험하고, 퍼즐을 풀고, 침